{'symbol': 'LOW', 'date': '2023-01-24 08:00:00', 'title': "LOWE'S INVITES COMMUNITIES NATIONWIDE TO NOMINATE PROJECTS FOR LOWE'S HOMETOWNS IMPACT PROGRAM", 'text': "100 SIGNATURE PROJECTS WILL BE SELECTED FROM NOMINATIONS TO REBUILD OR RENOVATE COMMUNITY SPACES AS LOWE'S CONTINUES FIVE-YEAR, $100 MILLION COMMITMENT MOORESVILLE, N.C. , JAN. 24, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- AS PART OF ITS GOAL TO MAKE HOMES – AND HOMETOWNS – BETTER FOR ALL, LOWE'S TODAY ANNOUNCED IT IS ACCEPTING NOMINATIONS FOR THE SECOND YEAR OF LOWE'S HOMETOWNS, A FIVE-YEAR, $100 MILLION IMPACT PROGRAM AND THE COMPANY'S LARGEST-EVER COMMITMENT OF ITS KIND."}